@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam participantPadding 20
skinparam boxPadding 10

box "Client Device" #ffffff
actor Usuario as "User"
participant Script as "Wallet Module"
database SeedFile as "Seed File\n(Mnemonic)"
end box

Usuario -> Script: Request Key Generation\n(Inputs: File Path, index)
activate Script

Script -> SeedFile: Read Mnemonic (12 words)
activate SeedFile
SeedFile --> Script: Raw Content
deactivate SeedFile

note right of Script
  **Pre-processing:**
  Normalize whitespaces and line breaks
end note
Script -> Script: Process Mnemonic Text

note right of Script
  **BIP-39 Validation:**
  Verify words against wordlist and checksum
end note
Script -> Script: Validate Seed Mnemonic

note right of Script
  **BIP-44 Path Construction:**
  Template: m/44'/60'/0'/0/{index}
  Replace {index} with provided integer
end note
Script -> Script: Construct Derivation Path

note right of Script
  **Key Derivation (BIP-32/BIP-44):**
  m / 44' / 60' / 0' / 0 / **index**
end note
Script -> Script: Compute Cryptographic Keys

note right of Script
  **Local Output:**
  Generate active keypair
end note
Script --> Usuario: Return (Pseudonymous Address, Private Key)
deactivate Script

@enduml